Title: AROS configuration switches for the core
Repository: boxer (https://github.com/alinebee/Boxer.git)
Date: 2026-10-01
Author: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Base-Commit: 0062fc18e154cde6cef3bf3329be4b0658597e31
Preceding-Patches: 0001-aros-host-sdl-seam.patch
Problem: DOSBox/config.h is Boxer's hand-maintained configuration for macOS. On AROS x86_64 it enables features without host support (serial/IPX/modem via SDL_net, OpenGL, SDL_sound, process priority, mprotect) and forces C_FPU_X86, whose inline assembly is i386-only and fails to assemble for x86_64.
Solution: Add an __AROS__ block that undefines those switches: MACOSX, C_FPU_X86 (stock DOSBox configure enables it for i386 only), C_HAVE_MPROTECT (AROS memory is executable, the dynrec cache needs no mprotect), C_DIRECTSERIAL, C_IPX, C_MODEM, C_OPENGL, C_SDL_SOUND, C_SET_PRIORITY, HAVE_NETINET_IN_H, HAVE_SYS_SOCKET_H. Disabled features are recorded as port limitations, not dropped from scope: CD audio from compressed tracks (SDL_sound), IPX/serial networking.
Platform-Scope: AROS (all architectures; C_DYNREC stays selected for x86_64 by the existing logic).
Upstream-Status: local-only
Verification: 2026-10-01: with 0001, all 119 TUs compile for ABIv11 and mainline v1 (GCC 10.5.0); boxer-core-smoke links on both. Runtime not tested yet.
Removal-Condition: Revisit each switch when its host support is ported (SDL_sound/SDL_net equivalents, serial).

diff --git a/DOSBox/config.h b/DOSBox/config.h
index 73f8c598f20e45108cb9012f376382028043822d..2e9b8fd3d45aa0e763080e6da7a78533e1d5f0db 100644
--- a/DOSBox/config.h
+++ b/DOSBox/config.h
@@ -375,3 +375,21 @@ typedef		int64_t		Bit64s;
 
 */
 //--End of modifications
+
+/* AROS: features whose host support is absent or not yet ported. Boxer forced
+ * C_FPU_X86 on for x86_64 too, but its inline assembly is i386-only (stock
+ * DOSBox configure enables it for i386 alone); the dynrec cache needs no
+ * mprotect because AROS memory is executable. */
+#ifdef __AROS__
+#undef MACOSX
+#undef C_FPU_X86
+#undef C_HAVE_MPROTECT
+#undef C_DIRECTSERIAL
+#undef C_IPX
+#undef C_MODEM
+#undef C_OPENGL
+#undef C_SDL_SOUND
+#undef C_SET_PRIORITY
+#undef HAVE_NETINET_IN_H
+#undef HAVE_SYS_SOCKET_H
+#endif
